        "en": "After using the Technique, creates a Special Dimension that lasts for #1[i] seconds. Enemies caught in the Special Dimension are inflicted with Dream Prison and stop all their actions. Upon entering battle against enemies afflicted with Dream Prison, increases the Hits Per Action for Misha's next Ultimate by #2[i] hit(s). Only 1 Dimension Effect created by allies can exist at the same time.",
